# Paths OUTSIDE this stack that event's own tests read.
#
# stacks-ci.yml builds its matrix from the stacks a diff touches, so a test
# that reads another stack's or a domain's file cannot fire on the change that
# breaks it -- that change runs a matrix which excludes this stack. Every
# pattern here also selects event's matrix entry. UIFPE-728.
#
# One pattern per line, git pathspec syntax, # for comments. The detect step
# REFUSES a pattern matching no tracked file, so a stale entry fails loudly
# rather than silently watching nothing.

# qe/test_uat_deployment.py reads each domain's event Terraform: a domain seeds
# its own rows into this stack's config tables, and the ConfigSeeds grant that
# allows it is hand-written because no derivation can see those rows. If a
# domain starts seeding a third table, that test must fail here (UIFPE-774).
domains/*/infrastructure/terraform/*_events.tf
